# GitHub language statistics must describe THIS project, not the mirror.
#
# The repository is 3,864 vendored third-party files plus Blackhearts-authored
# documentation. Left alone, GitHub attributes the majority of the repo to
# vendored Python and the language bar is a lie about what this project is.
# These attributes make the statistics honest: vendored content is marked
# vendored, generated artefacts are marked generated, and the documentation is
# marked documentation, so the bar reflects the code Blackhearts actually owns.

# --- vendored third-party content: counted separately, never "ours"
skills/third-party/**      linguist-vendored
skills/third-party/**      linguist-generated=true
skills/catalog/**          linguist-vendored
skills/licenses/**         linguist-vendored

# --- Blackhearts-authored automation: this is the real code in the repo
.github/scripts/*.py       linguist-language=Python
.github/scripts/*.py       linguist-detectable=true

# --- documentation, everywhere, including inside the mirror
*.md                       linguist-documentation
*.md                       linguist-documentation=true

# --- generated and data artefacts
.github/UPSTREAM-MANIFEST.json     linguist-generated=true
.github/upstream-link-defects.json linguist-generated=true
skills/openclaw.example.json5     linguist-generated=true
skills/catalog/CATEGORY-INDEX.md   linguist-generated=true
FILE-INDEX.txt                     linguist-generated=true
CHANGELOG.md                       linguist-generated

# --- keep line endings stable so the integrity check is meaningful
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.apk binary
*.aab binary
